> ## Recommendation
> Build this in **two layers**:
> 
> ### A. `OpenAIMemoryModel`
> A concrete `MemoryModel` implementation that:
> - does live calls synchronously
> - can use either:
>   - direct OpenAI API
>   - your `chatwrap`
> - is the main thing `LongTermMemory` and `ConversationMemory` use
