> - possibly `build_retrieval_query(...)`
> 
> ## LLM methods
> These do benefit from a model call:
> - `summarize_conversation(...)`
> - `summarize_turn_delta(...)`
> - `extract_candidate_memories(...)`
> - `merge_profile(...)`
