> For a first real implementation, I’d actually keep:
> - `summarize_turn_delta(...)` mostly heuristic / lightweight
> - `build_retrieval_query(...)` heuristic
> - `build_prompt_memory_block(...)` deterministic
> 
> and use the LLM for:
> - conversation summary
> - candidate extraction
> - maybe profile merge
