> ```python
> prior = (
>     0.55 * memory.importance +
>     0.35 * memory.confidence +
>     0.10 * kind_prior_bonus
> )
> ```
> 
> Where `kind_prior_bonus` might be:
> 
> ```python
> {
>     "fact": 0.20,
>     "preference": 0.20,
>     "project": 0.18,
>     "correction": 0.22,
>     "task": 0.10,
>     "episode": 0.05,
>     "conversation_summary": 0.03,
>     "artifact": 0.05,
> }
