>    - keep
>    - update
>    - deactivate
>    - merge
>    - archive stale task
>    - maybe promote to profile/project/task
> 4. apply those actions
> 5. repeat over time
> 
> This is much better for:
> - incoherent fragments
> - duplicates
> - stale tasks
> - outdated preferences
> - contradictory memories
> - cut-off text
> 
> And it avoids re-ingestion.
